    "result": {"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<p>The Webmaster is responsible for maintaining this website.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Course:</strong> 4th Year Astrophysics</li>\n<li><strong>Instrument:</strong> Violin</li>\n<li><strong>Favourite piece of music:</strong> <em>Verklärte Nacht</em> by Arnold Schoenberg</li>\n<li><strong>Favourite thing about EUSO:</strong> The people! I miss everyone in the lovely little EUSO community.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Here are a few words from Ainslie:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>你好 ！ I'm Ainslie, your webmaster in absentia. I'm currently on my year abroad in Hong Kong, but I maintain the website behind the scenes, and will be back in EUSO next year!</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/contact/\">Contact information</a></p>","timeToRead":1,"excerpt":"The Webmaster is responsible for maintaining this website. Course: 4th Year Astrophysics Instrument: Violin Favourite piece of music:…","frontmatter":{"title":"Ainslie – Webmaster","thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"fixed":{"base64":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","width":150,"height":150,"src":"/static/23e6e5465a3e88ac2becaa6edc3c8d81/dcd9a/webmaster.jpg","srcSet":"/static/23e6e5465a3e88ac2becaa6edc3c8d81/dcd9a/webmaster.jpg 1x,\n/static/23e6e5465a3e88ac2becaa6edc3c8d81/66ecd/webmaster.jpg 1.5x,\n/static/23e6e5465a3e88ac2becaa6edc3c8d81/25e3f/webmaster.jpg 2x"}}},"slug":"committee-webmaster","date":null,"categories":null,"tags":null,"template":"committee"},"fields":{"slug":"/committee-webmaster/","date":null}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/committee-webmaster/"}},
